WEBVTT

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.976
thinking about blowing
up nuclear rockets and stuff.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.976
I was thinking about making
my own little rockets.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.976
And I knew that frogs -- little frogs --

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.976
had aspirations of space travel,

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.976
just like people. And I --

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.976
(Laughter)

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.976
I was looking for a --

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.976
a propulsion system

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.976
that would like, make a rocket, like,

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.429
maybe about four feet high
go up a couple of miles.

00:12:54.453 --> 00:12:56.976
And, I mean, that was my sort of goal.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.334
I wanted it to go out of sight and then
I wanted this little parachute